VideoShrink is a multi-platform project. Different platforms are distributed under
different licences:

  windows/   GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
             Full text: windows/LICENSE

  linux/     GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0)
             Full text: linux/LICENSE

  android/   MIT License
             Full text: android/LICENSE

Bundled and linked third-party components are listed, with their licences, in:

  windows/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
  linux/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
  android/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

The Android native FFmpeg build is LGPL-2.1-or-later; its exact source archives are
attached to the corresponding GitHub release.
